{"metadata":{"role":"article","title":"List and Table Components","modules":[{"name":"TUIkit"}],"roleHeading":"Article"},"sections":[],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/ListAndTable","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"abstract":[{"text":"Build scrollable, navigable data collections with keyboard support.","type":"text"}],"kind":"article","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit"]]},"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"level":2,"text":"Overview","anchor":"Overview","type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"TUIkit provides two components for displaying collections of data:"}]},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"List"}]},{"type":"text","text":": A vertical collection of arbitrary view content with selection support"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Table"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": A columnar data display with headers and configurable column widths","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Both components share the same keyboard navigation and selection infrastructure, providing a consistent user experience."}]},{"level":2,"text":"List","anchor":"List","type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"List","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" displays a vertical collection of items inside a bordered container. It supports:","type":"text"}]},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Optional title in the border","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Optional footer section","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Single or multi-selection"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Keyboard navigation","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Automatic scrolling with viewport management"}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"level":3,"text":"Basic Usage","anchor":"Basic-Usage","type":"heading"},{"code":["struct ContentView: View {","    @State var selectedID: String?","    ","    let items = [\"Apple\", \"Banana\", \"Cherry\", \"Date\", \"Elderberry\"]","    ","    var body: some View {","        List(\"Fruits\", selection: $selectedID) {","            ForEach(items, id: \\.self) { item in","                Text(item)","            }","        }","    }","}"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"level":3,"text":"With Footer","anchor":"With-Footer","type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Add action buttons or status text in a footer section:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["List(\"Tasks\", selection: $selectedTask) {","    ForEach(tasks) { task in","        Text(task.title)","    }","} footer: {","    ButtonRow {","        Button(\"Add\") { addTask() }","        Button(\"Remove\") { removeTask() }","    }","}"]},{"level":3,"text":"Multi-Selection","type":"heading","anchor":"Multi-Selection"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Use a ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Set"},{"text":" binding for multi-selection mode:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["@State var selectedIDs: Set<String> = []","","List(\"Files\", selection: $selectedIDs) {","    ForEach(files) { file in","        HStack {","            Text(file.icon)","            Text(file.name)","        }","    }","}"]},{"level":3,"text":"Visual States","type":"heading","anchor":"Visual-States"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"List rows display different visual states:"}]},{"header":"row","type":"table","rows":[[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"State"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Appearance"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Focused + Selected"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Pulsing accent background"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Focused only","type":"text"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Highlight background bar"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Selected only"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Subtle accent background","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Neither","type":"text"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Default appearance","type":"text"}]}]]]},{"level":2,"text":"Table","type":"heading","anchor":"Table"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"Table","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" displays tabular data with column headers, alignment, and configurable widths.","type":"text"}]},{"level":3,"text":"Basic Usage","type":"heading","anchor":"Basic-Usage"},{"code":["struct FileInfo: Identifiable {","    let id: String","    let name: String","    let size: String","    let modified: String","}","","struct ContentView: View {","    @State var selectedFile: String?","    let files: [FileInfo] = [...]","    ","    var body: some View {","        Table(files, selection: $selectedFile) {","            TableColumn(\"Name\", value: \\.name)","            TableColumn(\"Size\", value: \\.size)","                .width(.fixed(10))","                .alignment(.trailing)","            TableColumn(\"Modified\", value: \\.modified)","        }","    }","}"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"type":"heading","text":"Column Configuration","anchor":"Column-Configuration","level":3},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Columns support three width modes:"}]},{"code":["TableColumn(\"Name\", value: \\.name)","    .width(.flexible)        \/\/ Shares remaining space (default)","","TableColumn(\"Size\", value: \\.size)","    .width(.fixed(12))       \/\/ Exactly 12 characters","","TableColumn(\"Progress\", value: \\.progress)","    .width(.ratio(0.3))      \/\/ 30% of available width"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"type":"heading","text":"Column Alignment","anchor":"Column-Alignment","level":3},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Align column content to leading, center, or trailing:"}]},{"code":["TableColumn(\"Amount\", value: \\.amount)","    .alignment(.trailing)    \/\/ Right-align numbers"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"type":"heading","text":"Keyboard Navigation","anchor":"Keyboard-Navigation","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Both List and Table support the same keyboard shortcuts:"}]},{"header":"row","type":"table","rows":[[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Key"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Action"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Up"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Move focus up (wraps to end)"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Down"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Move focus down (wraps to start)"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Home","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Jump to first item","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"End","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Jump to last item"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Page Up"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Move up by viewport height"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Page Down","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Move down by viewport height","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"